Adaptation 15-how-read-only-explore

Added here, not in the fork:
- `how` names Claude Code's read-only `Explore` agent type. Claude Code's `Agent` tool has no
  `readonly` field, so `general-purpose` with `readonly: true` started a writable agent there.
  Harnesses without `Explore` keep `general-purpose` with `readonly: true`, which their
  `poteto-mode/references/*-tools.md` maps translate (pi-tools.md still names `how` as its user).

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

Rebased to port commit 1ab6b82.

